{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "05AY", "placeholders": {"STRUCT_0001": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R2", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:c5ebb9c4228fd4897ee52a6312dd041dafee9845948d49da8a3255de929bb2cd", "source_text": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\nIn this section we prove that one can check quasi-coherent module\nhas a certain finiteness conditions by checking on the members of\na covering.\n\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:408309f286ca29379692e7e936458fee74f4cfb974e363ad9b40d0460248d161", "unit_id": "tag:05AY:prose-0001"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05AY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\{f_i : X_i \\to X\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0005": "$f_i^*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X_i}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-type-descends}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:707367935437be401692e5d9028881c7dfb12c71ffb99cd77d52416f4f0b135c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:b1f9bd39c54cff7ae887737dd6b71f5a1193aa0cc7925a4118d0b53d31ee6f8e", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a quasi-coherent <MATH_0003>-module.\nLet <MATH_0004> be an fpqc covering such that\neach <MATH_0005> is a finite type <MATH_0006>-module.\nThen <MATH_0007> is a finite type <MATH_0008>-module.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2b87425fb64c11f031f87e0407c5a8dbf11fcd4dca2176839a9fa843beccbe74", "unit_id": "tag:05AZ:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "05AY", "placeholders": {"REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-descend-properties-modules}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:44136fa355b3678a1146ad16f7e8649e94fb4fc21fe77e8310c060f61caaff8a", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:7624f422b5f1bb6aeab997ead1c4c7b737879c4a3e209a35dbf91f1184336e60", "source_text": "Omitted. For the affine case, see\nAlgebra, Lemma <REF_0001>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:f20d272da871f8bf0403387ef0e5f59b3215087aacb94b30475680a12862f35a", "unit_id": "tag:05AZ:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05AY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$f : (X, \\mathcal{O}_X) \\to (Y, \\mathcal{O}_Y)$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_Y$", "MATH_0004": "$f$", "MATH_0005": "$f$", "MATH_0006": "$f^*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\begin{enumerate}", "STRUCT_0002": "\\item", "STRUCT_0003": "\\item", "STRUCT_0004": "\\item", "STRUCT_0005": "\\end{enumerate}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-type-descends-fppf}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:92b8ad557e41605122104bd5b96859487d9b61b3969d9046067cfe2598d3443e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9a990bad163790ea21a6f440c668e96d5555f94fed313117d6f10c16f36f97a5", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a morphism of\nlocally ringed spaces. Let <MATH_0002> be a sheaf of <MATH_0003>-modules.\nIf\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> is open as a map of topological spaces,\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0005> is surjective and flat, and\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0006> is of finite type,\n<STRUCT_0005>\nthen <MATH_0007> is of finite type.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:d9c26987ca2f1716e01a103f60d2f82407a832a66f3c4d76dc77bcb2c8e62bbe", "unit_id": "tag:09UB:statement"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "05AY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$y \\in Y$", "MATH_0002": "$x \\in X$", "MATH_0003": "$y$", "MATH_0004": "$x \\in U \\subset X$", "MATH_0005": "$s_1, \\ldots, s_n$", "MATH_0006": "$f^*\\mathcal{F}(U)$", "MATH_0007": "$f^*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$U$", "MATH_0009": "$f^*\\mathcal{F} =\nf^{-1}\\mathcal{F} \\otimes_{f^{-1}\\mathcal{O}_Y} \\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0010": "$U$", "MATH_0011": "$s_i = \\sum t_{ij} \\otimes a_{ij}$", "MATH_0012": "$t_{ij} \\in f^{-1}\\mathcal{F}(U)$", "MATH_0013": "$a_{ij} \\in \\mathcal{O}_X(U)$", "MATH_0014": "$U$", "MATH_0015": "$t_{ij}$", "MATH_0016": "$s_{ij} \\in \\mathcal{F}(V)$", "MATH_0017": "$V \\subset Y$", "MATH_0018": "$f(U) \\subset V$", "MATH_0019": "$N$", "MATH_0020": "$s_{ij}$", "MATH_0021": "$$\n\\sigma = (s_{ij}) : \\mathcal{O}_V^{\\oplus N} \\to \\mathcal{F}|_V\n$$", "MATH_0022": "$f^*\\sigma|_U$", "MATH_0023": "$u \\in U$", "MATH_0024": "$$\n\\sigma_{f(u)} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{Y, f(u)}} \\mathcal{O}_{X, u} :\n\\mathcal{O}_{X, u}^{\\oplus N}\n\\longrightarrow\n\\mathcal{F}_{f(u)} \\otimes_{\\mathcal{O}_{Y, f(u)}} \\mathcal{O}_{X, u}\n$$", "MATH_0025": "$f$", "MATH_0026": "$\\mathcal{O}_{Y, f(u)} \\to \\mathcal{O}_{X, u}$", "MATH_0027": "$\\sigma_{f(u)}$", "MATH_0028": "$f$", "MATH_0029": "$f(U)$", "MATH_0030": "$y$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{algebra-lemma-local-flat-ff}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:ce5e68cc1ecca1fba6a2531d193422238003603d93f81db60ef0ea168226adbd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9ddb779123f37dad40e13ad5707bee44c8f7052a441b46e3b12523847cf04f12", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a point. Choose a point <MATH_0002> mapping to <MATH_0003>.\nChoose an open <MATH_0004> and elements <MATH_0005>\nof <MATH_0006> which generate <MATH_0007> over <MATH_0008>.\nSince <MATH_0009>\nwe can after shrinking <MATH_0010> assume <MATH_0011>\nwith <MATH_0012> and <MATH_0013>.\nAfter shrinking <MATH_0014> further we may assume that <MATH_0015> comes from\na section <MATH_0016> for some <MATH_0017> open\nwith <MATH_0018>. Let <MATH_0019> be the number of sections <MATH_0020> and\nconsider the map\n<MATH_0021>\nBy our choice of the sections we see that <MATH_0022> is surjective.\nHence for every <MATH_0023> the map\n<MATH_0024>\nis surjective. As <MATH_0025> is flat, the local ring map\n<MATH_0026> is flat, hence\nfaithfully flat (Algebra, Lemma <REF_0001>).\nHence <MATH_0027> is surjective. Since <MATH_0028> is open, <MATH_0029> is\nan open neighbourhood of <MATH_0030> and the proof is done.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:c1c4de098e0c0edd11df42ff8ffe434a6fb6b040665e94967520f1a84fddc9ba", "unit_id": "tag:09UB:proof"}
{"chapter": "descent", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "05AY", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0003": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$", "MATH_0004": "$\\{f_i : X_i \\to X\\}_{i \\in I}$", "MATH_0005": "$f_i^*\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0006": "$\\mathcal{O}_{X_i}$", "MATH_0007": "$\\mathcal{F}$", "MATH_0008": "$\\mathcal{O}_X$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-finite-presentation-descends}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:707367935437be401692e5d9028881c7dfb12c71ffb99cd77d52416f4f0b135c", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:9065921641599cd385efb7b201637211de5a71342708e9575f5669617dbed75d", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme.\nLet <MATH_0002> be a quasi-coherent <MATH_0003>-module.\nLet <MATH_0004> be an fpqc covering such that\neach <MATH_0005> is an <MATH_0006>-module of finite\npresentation. Then <MATH_0007> is an <MATH_0008>-module\nof finite presentation.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:9985dbf3bd0683b73a06b12c74b5d66541cda8d5543ab53b8a366e52b65d958c", "unit_id": "tag:05B0:statement"}
